---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "广州旅游指南：中国的美食之都";
const description = "Explore Guangzhou — China's food capital with world-famous dim sum, Cantonese culture, and easy access to Hong Kong.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏙️ 广州</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">广州旅游指南：中国美食之都</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">探索广州-中国美食之都，拥有世界闻名的点心、粤菜文化和前往香港的便利。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500"><span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span><span>⏱️ 阅读7分钟</span></div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-teal-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">⚡ 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">If you eat to live in Beijing, you <strong>在广州吃住</strong>. This southern city is widely regarded as <strong>中国食品之都</strong>，广东菜的发源地，可以说是世界上最著名的中国菜。除了食物，广州还提供亚热带的绿色植物，轻松的步伐，以及接近深圳和香港。</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#why-visit" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🥟 为什么去广州？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-many-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📅 你需要多少天？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#attractions" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎯 热门景点</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 出行</a></li>
        <li><a href="#where-to-stay" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏨 住在哪里</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-to-eat" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍜 吃什么</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="why-visit" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🥟 为什么去广州？</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">广州作为贸易港口已有1000多年的历史。在这里，粤菜——点心、烤肉、慢炖汤——被完善并出口到世界各地。这座城市拥有亚热带气候（全年温暖），充满活力的河滨，以及与北方截然不同的广东文化。它也是通往珠江三角洲的门户：深圳乘坐高铁30分钟，香港大约一小时。</p>

    <h2 id="how-many-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">📅 你需要多少天？</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>2-3天（标准）：</strong> Dim sum, Canton Tower, Shamian Island, and a food tour</li>
      <li><strong>4-5天（舒适）：</strong> Add Chimelong Safari Park, Kaiping Diaolou, or cross to Shenzhen</li>
      <li><strong>5+天（延长）：</strong> Combine with Shenzhen and Hong Kong for a complete Pearl River Delta trip</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="attractions" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🎯 热门景点</h2>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">广州塔</h3><p class="text-gray-700">标志性的“超级模特”塔高600米。上去欣赏城市的全景，或者在旋转餐厅吃饭。晚上的灯光秀很壮观。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">沙面岛</h3><p class="text-gray-700">这是一个前英法租界，拥有殖民地建筑、绿树成荫的林荫大道和轻松的公园氛围。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">陈家祠</h3><p class="text-gray-700">一座令人惊叹的清代祠堂，有精美的木雕、陶器和刺绣。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">越秀公园</h3><p class="text-gray-700">这座城市最大的公园，是广州的象征——五羊像的所在地。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">北京路</h3><p class="text-gray-700">一条玻璃地板的步行购物街，下面是古老的宋代道路。</p></div>

    <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🚇 出行</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>地铁：</strong> Guangzhou's metro has 16 lines and reaches all major attractions. English signs everywhere. Check the <a href="/zh/transport/metro-bus/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">中国主要城市地铁和公交指南</a> for an overview.</li>
      <li><strong>迪迪：</strong> Cheap and widely available. A ride across the city center costs about 30–50 RMB. See <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">外国人如何在中国使用滴滴</a> for setup and tips.</li>
      <li><strong>珠江码头：</strong> A scenic way to cross the river. Ferries run regularly between piers on both sides.</li>
      <li><strong>高速铁路：</strong> Guangzhou South Station connects to Shenzhen (30 min), Hong Kong (1 hour), and Zhuhai/Macau (1 hour). Read the <a href="/zh/transport/high-speed-rail/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">如何预订和乘坐中国高铁</a> for booking instructions.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="where-to-stay" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🏨 住在哪里</h2>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">荔湾区——美食爱好者的最佳选择</h3><p class="text-gray-700">老广州的心脏。入住这里，品尝正宗的粤菜餐厅和早茶。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">天河区——现代旅客的最佳选择</h3><p class="text-gray-700">新的中央商务区有购物中心、国际酒店和良好的地铁连接。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">海珠区——最佳河景</h3><p class="text-gray-700">从市中心穿过珠江。安静，可以欣赏到广州塔的美景。</p></div>

    <h2 id="what-to-eat" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🍜 吃什么</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>点心</strong> — Har gow, siu mai, char siu bao, and cheung fun. Morning tea culture (yum cha) is a must-experience.</li>
      <li><strong>白切鸡</strong> — Poached chicken served cold with ginger-scallion oil.</li>
      <li><strong>烧鹅——邵娥</strong> — Crispy-skinned roast goose with plum sauce.</li>
      <li><strong>云吞面</strong> — Thin egg noodles with shrimp-and-pork wontons.</li>
      <li><strong>蛤蜊饭--包载凡</strong> — Rice cooked in a clay pot with Chinese sausage or chicken.</li>
      <li><strong>双皮奶--双皮奶</strong> — A silky, sweet milk pudding from Shunde.</li>
      <li><strong>凉茶--凉茶</strong> — A bitter medicinal tea locals swear by.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="not-prose mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a href="/zh/cities/city-select/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🗺️ <strong>在中国有多少天？</strong> — Plan your full itinerary</a>
        <a href="/zh/cities/shenzhen-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🤖 <strong>-香港旁边的科技中心</strong> — Just 30 minutes away</a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">💳 <strong>支付宝、微信支付以及一切与金钱有关的东西</strong> — Guangzhou is fully cashless</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>